{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enter the year of 2057 and play this unique <strong>psychological horror experience</strong> set in a cyberpunk city run by tyrannical corporations in the process of scraping the last pieces of humanity from society.\u00a0You will need to <strong>hack</strong> into devices through a <strong>Linux terminal</strong> to gather hidden information and uncover the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/514347746998b3de83d02b0752564e22.poster.avif?t=1758995836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/514347746998b3de83d02b0752564e22.webm?t=1758995836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/514347746998b3de83d02b0752564e22.mp4?t=1758995836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Faith, a young aspiring hacker</i></strong><i> one day wakes up to her father and all the memories of the last month of her life being gone. She enters a mysterious <strong>Apartment</strong> and slowly falls into a rabbit hole of memory-altering state-of-the-art <strong>Bio-Chip technology</strong>. <strong>Hack</strong> your way through <strong>The</strong> <strong>Apartment</strong> and try to piece together what really happened to Faith and her Father.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/c6d23385206a531edfc1abaccd8b9964.poster.avif?t=1758995836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/c6d23385206a531edfc1abaccd8b9964.webm?t=1758995836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/extras/c6d23385206a531edfc1abaccd8b9964.mp4?t=1758995836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linux-inspired terminal</strong> - Hack everything around you and extract data in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique mash-up of PS1 and cyberpunk aesthetics</strong> - Never seen before combination of retro-styled PS1 environments and sci-fi futuristic elements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full in tense fear and terror</strong> - Creepy apartments, scary, gory imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> - Recommended for optimal experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTICE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The assets, gifs and artworks you see on this game's page show in-development look at the game. Nothing is final and is subject to change.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999150?t=1758995836","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/25a20c317b239e42881e17540a8dc2f7f26ef8f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758995836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/c1553a2b520ceb5e99e6070f486c83dfec8b8df5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758995836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999150/c1553a2b520ceb5e99e6070f486c83dfec8b8df5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758995836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains content that could be explicit to some users such as: limb amputation, self-harm, torture, psychological torture."},"detailed_descrip